    {
      "id": "04557d28-be1c-4580-9772-cb276fd9aafb",
      "name": "Setup and operating contract",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        600
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ElevenLabs server tool\nPOST /webhook/accountai-qualify with a Header Auth secret. ElevenLabs transcribes speech and speaks the returned `speech`; this is a conversation tool, not a post-call webhook or an outbound call. Send the cumulative BANT evidence in `message`. Optional `request_id` must uniquely identify one tool invocation; reuse it only for retries. `conversation_id` is not used as a dedupe key. Only pass `preferred_date` when the prospect has requested booking.\n\nThe SQL RPC atomically stores contact and BANT log and computes hot/warm/cold. The hot path ensures an open deal. Customer status is preserved in SQL. Select OpenRouter, Supabase and HTTP Header Auth credentials after import. Chat model pricing depends on provider; the requested ID is not guaranteed free.",
        "width": 1000,
        "height": 320
      }
    },
